1. version 3.9.2 
  1) CalcHEP distribution comes with a  manual 
  2) We fixed a bug in batch calculation that occurred when some subprocesses were kinematically disabled.
     Now such subprocesses are ignored.
  3) In some models there are processes which have zero matrix element in spite the  existence of Feynman 
     diagrams. In the current version numerical code (n_calchep) for such processes is not generated, whereas in previous 
     versions CalcHEP generated numerical code with zero matrix element. 
  4) The commands which increase/decrease size of X11 window  (Ctrl+/Ctrl-)  are improved.
   